# A measurement, not a test (docs/tg-window-report.md): tg's memory as `top` shows it.
# `top` counts rooms, so tg is launched alone in a room with a memory limit, logged in,
# a long chat opened and scrolled to its start (every page loaded and laid out), and the
# first terminal's `top` is kept as a screen. Scale 1; with one room the dock's tiles are
# 26 further left (tg 526) and the room's chip is at 678.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
type mkdir tgroom\r
screen ~> _
type room new tgroom --mem 96M +w ~/tgroom\r
screen ~> _
pause 2000
shot mem-dock
click 678 722
pause 1000
click 526 722
serial tg: login phone
pause 1500
click 500 119
pause 500
type 0000\r
then tg: login code
type 12345\r
then tg: login password
type zoraya\r
then tg: ready
pause 1000
click 255 217
then tg: opened "Zoraya — розробка":
wheel 700 350 up 30
then tg: older 40, 80 loaded, more
wheel 700 350 up 30
serial tg: older 40, 120 loaded, more
wheel 700 350 up 40
serial tg: older 33, 153 loaded
pause 1000
shot mem-window
# The first terminal again (its title bar's left end), and top.
click 300 87
pause 800
type top\r
pause 2500
shot mem-top
